"Ritual How-To": {
  "index": -2,
  "category": "rituals",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Initial Setup"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Rituals",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " are more in-depth magical castings that provide more powerful or long term effects than an instant cast spell typically will. \n\nIt involves additional preparation, reagents, and interactions to complete the effect, but there are some very powerful effects that can be achieved. \n\nTo start, I need to draw the pattern on the ground using "
        },
        {
          "text": "Wizard's Chalk",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". "
        },
        {
          "text": "The orientation doesn't matter",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nThen, I need to "
        },
        {
          "text": "activate the center",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the ritual using "
        },
        {
          "text": "Purified Vinteum Dust",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This will cause the ritual to begin displaying the needed reagents. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Reagent numbers, if present, in gold are mandatory, and numbers in white are optional.",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": " \n\nLastly, I need to "
        },
        {
          "text": "place the reagents",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the correct positions, then "
        },
        {
          "text": "activate the center of the ritual again",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " using "
        },
        {
          "text": "Purified Vinteum Dust",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This will cause the ritual to begin casting."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Collecting Reagents"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The ritual will power up and then begin drawing in the reagents. I must take extra care to ensure that "
        },
        {
          "text": "no reagents are removed and that the chalk runes remain intact",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", lest I encounter more..."
        },
        {
          "text": "explosive results",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Not all rituals require reagents."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Manaweaving"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "After the reagents are consumed, the ritual will begin displaying "
        },
        {
          "text": "manaweave patterns",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nI need to "
        },
        {
          "text": "draw the required pattern",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " (or use a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaweave Projector",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " or "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bottled Manaweave",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " to create it), and the ritual will draw it in, then display the next pattern. Not all rituals require patterns. Once all patterns are added, the ritual will complete over the next few seconds."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Dynamic Reagents"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Some rituals require an item to display reagents, such as the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Arcana",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " requiring a spell recipe. I will need to place the item in first, and then the remaining reagents will be displayed. \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "I do not need to reactivate the ritual using Purified Vinteum Dust for the dynamic reagents to be displayed.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
